10:["$","p","p-3",{"children":"按照惯例，我们先来思考数据结构该如何定义。所谓读写锁，即读锁与读锁之间是可以共存，而读锁与写锁、写锁与写锁之间是互斥的。"}]
11:["$","ol","ol-2",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["我们需要一个变量 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"state"}]," 来表示当前是否有读线程、有多少读线程、是否有写线程，这里可以用 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"state"}]," 的值来表示有多少读线程，当其为最大值时，表示有写线程。因为 ",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://crates.io/crates/atomic-wait","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://crates.io/crates/atomic-wait"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"atomic-wait","position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":92,"offset":1538},"end":{"line":54,"column":103,"offset":1549}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":91,"offset":1537},"end":{"line":54,"column":142,"offset":1588}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"atomic-wait"}]," 仅支持 AtomicU32，所以这里我们的数据类型也定义为 AtomicU32."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["抢到写锁的时候，是可以对数据 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"value"}]," 进行修改的，但因我们只持有 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"&RwLock"}]," 共享引用，为了修改数据，我们依旧需要依赖 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"UnsafeCell"}]," 提供内部可变性。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["我们需要 2 个守卫类型，分别作为读守卫和写守卫，它们都持有 RwLock 的引用。\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["读守卫只能获取共享引用，所以我们为其实现 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Deref"}]," trait。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["写守卫可以获取独占引用，所以我们为其实现 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Deref"}]," 和 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"DerefMut"}]," trait。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":["另外，因为读锁是共享，写锁是独占，所以我们在为 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"RwLock<T>"}]," 实现 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Sync"}]," trait 的时候，要求 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"T"}]," 必须满足 ",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Sync+Sen